### Root Health Check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/
Accept: application/json

### Get Day Record
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/day/2026-10-10
Accept: application/json

### Get Stats
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/stats/2026-10-10
Accept: application/json

### Update Day Record
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/update_day/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-10-10",
  "study_time_seconds": 7200,
  "ball_time_seconds": 3600,
  "mood": "努力",
  "summary": "今天完成了文献综述并打了1小时羽毛球！"
}

### Location Checkin
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/locations/checkin/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "location_id": 1,
  "date": "2026-10-10"
}

### Get Month Records for Calendar
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/month_records/2026-10
Accept: application/json

### Get Tasks
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/tasks/
Accept: application/json

### Create Task
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/tasks/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "精读实验对比顶会论文",
  "category": "论文写作",
  "priority": "高",
  "status": "todo",
  "due_date": "2026-10-15"
}

### Get Academic Diaries
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/diaries/
Accept: application/json

### Create Academic Diary
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/diaries/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-10-10",
  "title": "实验调优进展顺利",
  "content": "今天重新设计了损失函数，验证集指标提升明显！",
  "tag": "实验心得",
  "mood": "开心"
}
